              }
            ],
            "SummarizedSegment": "The patient reports a difficult week at work due to increased pressure and deadlines."
          },
          {
            "EvidenceLinks": [
              {
                "SegmentId": "064a11a4-40b6-410c-95b0-1edae7551a42"
              },
              {
                "SegmentId": "d8d73b00-fe4e-4d71-b2b2-e0e457c974b4"
              },
              {
                "SegmentId": "e4dd7568-6468-4c19-853f-2f6419d8d25d"
              },
              {
                "SegmentId": "2d4134e1-ebc6-43e5-894a-edf1bf91becc"
              },
              {
                "SegmentId": "ba62e8ef-07e2-4525-bb0b-b30e9e14e2c0"
              }
            ],
            "SummarizedSegment": "They describe a setback in their coping strategies, having reverted to old patterns of overworking and self-neglect."
          },
          {
            "EvidenceLinks": [
              {
                "SegmentId": "064a11a4-40b6-410c-95b0-1edae7551a42"
              },
              {
                "SegmentId": "d8d73b00-fe4e-4d71-b2b2-e0e457c974b4"
              },
              {
                "SegmentId": "e4dd7568-6468-4c19-853f-2f6419d8d25d"
              },
              {
                "SegmentId": "2d4134e1-ebc6-43e5-894a-edf1bf91becc"
              },
              {
                "SegmentId": "ba62e8ef-07e2-4525-bb0b-b30e9e14e2c0"
              }
            ],
            "SummarizedSegment": "Specifically, the patient worked through dinner twice, skipped a scheduled Thursday break, and stayed late on Tuesday despite promising themselves they would leave on time.\n"
          },
          {
            "EvidenceLinks": [
              {
                "SegmentId": "03209f52-01ff-45fa-9819-62a358d627c1"
              },
              {
                "SegmentId": "2765736d-dcea-490b-9212-4b88657dc768"
              },
              {
                "SegmentId": "479cac66-1a4c-4218-9231-07b7440257c3"
              },
              {
                "SegmentId": "7be84dee-35a7-4c81-a95f-968b08530baa"
              }
            ],
            "SummarizedSegment": "The patient identified early warning signs of stress, including tight shoulders, exhaustion, and withdrawal from their partner Nora."
          },
          {
            "EvidenceLinks": [
              {
                "SegmentId": "e6275497-264a-4d63-b713-d9a0a4316780"
              },
              {
                "SegmentId": "dc0dc1fd-cb7a-400a-bf6e-d1038559bb0a"
              },
              {
                "SegmentId": "272e40ee-4797-4dab-afa9-821cb149b3ca"
              },
              {
                "SegmentId": "0f995642-a52a-47b0-b7cc-c19681a8f843"
              }
            ],
            "SummarizedSegment": "Despite recognizing these signs, they continued to work without seeking help, believing they had to handle the increased workload alone without inconveniencing others."
          },
          {
            "EvidenceLinks": [
              {
                "SegmentId": "e6275497-264a-4d63-b713-d9a0a4316780"
              },
              {
                "SegmentId": "dc0dc1fd-cb7a-400a-bf6e-d1038559bb0a"
              },
              {
                "SegmentId": "272e40ee-4797-4dab-afa9-821cb149b3ca"
              },
              {
                "SegmentId": "0f995642-a52a-47b0-b7cc-c19681a8f843"
              }
            ],
            "SummarizedSegment": "They did not ask their supervisor for clarification on priorities or inform them of the changed timeline.\n"
          },
          {
            "EvidenceLinks": [
              {
                "SegmentId": "cea73e75-1c1f-4e9b-936f-0ea91242fe7b"
              },
              {
                "SegmentId": "909aaaa4-0bdb-4378-af9d-d7010e8c9c27"
              },
              {
                "SegmentId": "389f24bc-05cb-4f88-a6fc-7944947b2db8"
              },
              {
                "SegmentId": "94f981a3-f327-499f-be9b-01fcf94cbab3"
              }
            ],
            "SummarizedSegment": "The patient reports that this pattern of behavior stems from a long-standing belief that asking for help is selfish, which they trace back to their family dynamics after their father became ill."
          },
          {
            "EvidenceLinks": [
              {
                "SegmentId": "cea73e75-1c1f-4e9b-936f-0ea91242fe7b"
              },
              {
                "SegmentId": "909aaaa4-0bdb-4378-af9d-d7010e8c9c27"
              },
              {
                "SegmentId": "389f24bc-05cb-4f88-a6fc-7944947b2db8"
              },
              {
                "SegmentId": "94f981a3-f327-499f-be9b-01fcf94cbab3"
              }
            ],
            "SummarizedSegment": "They describe becoming the person who could be counted on and not wanting to add to the family's burden.\n"
          },
          {
            "EvidenceLinks": [
              {
                "SegmentId": "85bb155b-61c6-46d4-815c-bf0e70807525"
              },
              {
                "SegmentId": "58cf41c3-ebfe-406e-a0bd-70e42f6ca250"
              },
              {
                "SegmentId": "0aebaa0f-bc24-461d-9ef0-19f09ff33922"
              },
              {
                "SegmentId": "3fc95711-cda4-40a9-9790-1f8cef4c7d75"
              },
              {
                "SegmentId": "cbc9394d-ebf4-4f21-acb5-88982f1523f3"
              }
            ],
            "SummarizedSegment": "The patient eventually told Nora they were overwhelmed, and she expressed frustration that they had shut her out but did not make the situation bigger than it was."
          },
          {
            "EvidenceLinks": [
              {
                "SegmentId": "85bb155b-61c6-46d4-815c-bf0e70807525"
              },
              {
                "SegmentId": "58cf41c3-ebfe-406e-a0bd-70e42f6ca250"
              },
              {
                "SegmentId": "0aebaa0f-bc24-461d-9ef0-19f09ff33922"
              },
              {
                "SegmentId": "3fc95711-cda4-40a9-9790-1f8cef4c7d75"
              },
              {
                "SegmentId": "cbc9394d-ebf4-4f21-acb5-88982f1523f3"
              }
            ],
            "SummarizedSegment": "Nora told the patient she does not need a perfect version of them, but rather needs to know when they are not okay.\n"
          },
          {
            "EvidenceLinks": [
              {
                "SegmentId": "4a3f18b7-e510-4105-9e1e-a8faa449f157"
              },
              {
                "SegmentId": "77bcbe96-f1e7-4c84-9823-eb289aa6f4ca"
