              },
              {
                "SegmentId": "0e22df9f-c38a-4d64-b374-6dd5b02a1314"
              }
            ],
            "SummarizedSegment": "The patient sat with Nora and told her it was a bad night."
          },
          {
            "EvidenceLinks": [
