              },
              {
                "SegmentId": "49f3a60e-626d-40b0-b03f-8ccd24196dc3"
              }
            ],
            "SummarizedSegment": "This conversation helped the patient realize that asking for support does not always create a burden and can allow others to be honest about their own struggles.\n"
